abstract: >-
  Canonical defensive-publication registry for the Resolutive Technology family.
  Version 0.2.0 extends the archival baseline with persistent concept identity
  and restart-safe native concept resolution, policy-first admissible routing
  across knowledge and heterogeneous compute resources, and an operational
  information-event trajectory codec with exact microscopic round-trip
  reconstruction in the documented recurrent domain. Claims remain limited to
  the specific mechanisms, evidence, assumptions and scope stated in each
  disclosure.
